SUMMARY:Zoom Budget Presentation for Next Fiscal Year (July 2026 to June 2027) (Zoom Only)
DESCRIPTION:Treasurer Bruce Hager\, Moderator Christine Brown\, and Executive Director Jon Thomsen warmly invite members of the congregation to an important presentation on zoom outlining the budget for the upcoming church year. This is an informational meeting. The congregational vote on the proposed budget will take place at the Annual Meeting held on Sunday\, June 14\, 2026. \nJoin us by clicking HERE.
